sa to use Enrage while disabled."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_reduction", "status_resistance", "duration", "damage_increase", "damage_increase_duration", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "applies_strong_dispel", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "damage_block", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "status_resistance", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_charge_of_darkness", "name_zh": "裂魂人·暗影冲刺", "name_en": "Charge of Darkness", "description_zh": "裂魂人盯紧一个敌方单位，开始无视一切物体的冲刺，起始为%min_movespeed_bonus_pct%%%额外移速，%windup_time%秒后达到最大速度。途中经过的所有敌方单位和目标单位都将受到巨力重击。如果目标单位在到达前阵亡，裂魂人将他的目标改为原路径上最近的一个敌方单位。", "description_en": "Spirit Breaker fixes his sight on an enemy unit and starts charging through all objects, starting at %min_movespeed_bonus_pct%%% of the bonus speed and reaching his max speed after %windup_time%s.All enemy units passed through and the targeted unit will be hit by a Greater Bash.  If the targeted unit dies, Spirit Breaker will change his target to the nearest enemy unit to that location.", "notes_zh": ["裂魂人在冲刺过程中能穿过树木，悬崖和任何单位。", "冲刺指示特效仅对队友可见。", "裂魂人将获得并共享目标的视野。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["movement_speed", "stun_duration", "bash_radius", "vision_radius", "vision_duration", "windup_time", "min_movespeed_bonus_pct", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "grant_vision", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "tree_walk", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_bulldoze", "name_zh": "裂魂人·威吓", "name_en": "Bulldoze", "description_zh": "裂魂人获得移动速度和状态抗性加成，在敌人之间横冲直撞。可以在冲刺期间使用。", "description_en": "Spirit Breaker gains movement speed and status resistance to ram through enemies. Can be used while charging.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["movement_speed", "status_resistance", "duration", "damage_barrier", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "status_resistance", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_greater_bash", "name_zh": "裂魂人·巨力重击", "name_en": "Greater Bash", "description_zh": "攻击时有一定概率眩晕并击退敌方单位。重击的伤害值为移动速度的一定百分比。", "description_en": "Gives a chance to stun and knockback an enemy unit on an attack. Deals a percentage of movement speed as damage.", "notes_zh": ["不与碎颅锤叠加。", "破坏会使攻击触发巨力重击失效。暗影冲刺或幽冥一击还是会施加巨力重击。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "击退效果提升。如果击退的敌人又撞到了一个敌人，这个敌人也会被重击（非英雄单位只受到%cascading_bashes_creep_penalty%%%伤害），并且原目标再次受到%cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier%%%的巨力重击伤害。", "en": "Increases knockback. If a knocked-back enemy collides with another enemy, the second enemy is bashed (creeps only receive %cascading_bashes_creep_penalty%%% damage), and the original target takes %cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier%%% of Greater Bash's damage again."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["chance_pct", "bonus_chance_pct", "bonus_chance_duration", "damage", "duration", "knockback_duration", "cascading_bash_cooldown", "cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier", "cascading_bashes_creep_penalty", "cascading_bashes_nether_strike_additional_cooldown", "cascading_bashes_hero_hitbox", "cascading_bashes_creep_hitbox", "knockback_distance", "knockback_height", "bonus_knockback_multiplier"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "bash", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "bash", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "displace_other", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_bull_rush", "name_zh": "裂魂人·神行太保", "name_en": "Empowering Haste", "description_zh": "裂魂人只要眩晕敌人就会获得移动速度加成。来自多个眩晕的效果会叠加，并且拥有独立的持续时间。暗影冲刺期间持续时间会暂停。", "description_en": "Spirit Breaker gains bonus Movement Speed for a duration whenever he stuns an enemy. Effects from multiple stuns stack and have independent durations. Duration pauses during Charge of Darkness.", "notes_zh": ["神行太保的加成状态使裂魂人能够突破移动速度上限。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["hero_duration", "creep_duration", "hero_movespeed_percent", "creep_movespeed_percent"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_nether_strike", "name_zh": "裂魂人·幽冥一击", "name_en": "Nether Strike", "description_zh": "裂魂人遁入幽冥领域，从不幸的目标身旁再次出现，发动当前等级的巨力重击并造成额外伤害。击退距离为平常的两倍。", "description_en": "Spirit Breaker slips into the nether realm, reappearing next to his hapless victim. Upon reappearing, a Greater Bash of the current level occurs and deals bonus damage. Knocks back for double the normal distance.", "notes_zh": ["裂魂人将在目标身后出现并发动巨力重击。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "大幅提升击退效果。", "en": "Greatly increases knockback."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "fade_time", "shard_bonus_damage", "shard_break_duration", "shard_spell_immune_duration", "knockback_amp", "knockback_amp_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "displace_other", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_homing_missile", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·追踪导弹", "name_en": "Homing Missile", "description_zh": "发射一枚会自动定位目标单位的追踪导弹。导弹发射后持续增加飞行速度，击中目标时造成伤害及眩晕。敌方单位可在导弹接近前将其击落。", "description_en": "Fires a homing missile to seek the targeted enemy unit. The missile gains speed over time, dealing damage and stunning when it impacts the target. Enemy units can destroy the missile before it reaches its target.", "notes_zh": ["防御塔对导弹造成半额伤害。", "准星效果仅对队友可见。", "导弹会跟随并击中隐身单位。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "追踪导弹现在从施放%shard_delay%秒后开始不断发射%shard_radius%作用范围的火箭弹幕。火箭弹幕优先以追踪导弹的目标为目标。", "en": "Homing Missiles now constantly fires the current level of Rocket Barrage in a %shard_radius% area of effect after %shard_delay% second of being cast. This Rocket Barrage prioritizes the Homing Missile target."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hits_to_kill_tooltip", "tower_hits_to_kill_tooltip", "stun_duration", "attack_speed_bonus_pct", "hit_damage", "max_distance", "pre_flight_time", "hero_damage", "speed", "acceleration", "enemy_vision_time", "shard_delay", "shard_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "invisibility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_flak_cannon", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·高射火炮", "name_en": "Flak Cannon", "description_zh": "矮人直升机的攻击会击中目标周围一定范围内的所有敌人，持续一定次数的攻击。只有主要目标会受到致命一击等攻击特效。持续%abilityduration%秒或攻击次数耗尽。", "description_en": "Gyrocopter's attacks hit all enemy units in an area around it for a limited number of attacks.  Only the main target of attacks will receive attack bonuses such as Critical Strike.  Lasts %abilityduration% seconds or until the attacks are used.", "notes_zh": ["对主目标的攻击距离没有改变。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "max_attacks", "projectile_speed", "bonus_damage", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "critical", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_afterburner", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·加力燃烧器", "name_en": "Afterburner", "description_zh": "矮人直升机通过攻击或技能对敌人造成伤害后，在短时间内获得移动速度提升。", "description_en": "Gyrocopter gains movement speed for a short duration after damaging an enemy with his attacks or abilities.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["bonus_movespeed_duration", "bonus_movement_speed_per_hit", "bonus_movement_speed_per_hit_creep"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_call_down", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·召唤飞弹", "name_en": "Call Down", "description_zh": "召唤%total_strikes%波防空导弹，对目标区域内的敌方单位造成减速和伤害。每次打击与上一次间隔%strike_separation%距离。", "description_en": "Call down %total_strikes% aerial missile strikes that slow and damage enemy units in a target area. Each strike is %strike_separation% distance from the previous one.", "notes_zh": ["视觉指示范围仅对队友可见。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["slow_duration", "slow", "damage", "radius", "missile_delay_tooltip", "strike_delay", "total_strikes", "strike_separation", "tracking_missile_damage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "alchemist_acid_spray", "name_zh": "炼金术士·酸性喷雾", "name_en": "Acid Spray", "description_zh": "向目标区域喷洒高压酸雾。穿过受污染地带的敌人每秒会受到物理伤害，同时护甲被削弱。", "description_en": "Sprays high-pressure acid across a target area. Enemy units who step across the contaminated terrain take damage per second and have their armor reduced.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "duration", "damage", "armor_reduction", "armor_allies", "tick_rate", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "alchemist_unstable_concoction", "name_zh": "炼金术士·不稳定化合物", "name_en": "Unstable Concoction", "description_zh": "炼金术士调制一瓶不稳定的化合物，投向敌方英雄，对爆炸点周边范围的单位造成伤害并眩晕。调制的时间越久，伤害越大，眩晕时间也越长。炼金术士在调制期间获得移动速度加成。调制%brew_time%秒后达到最大伤害量和最长眩晕时间。然而，若%brew_explosion%秒后未扔出药剂，则会在炼金术士自己手中爆炸。", "description_en": "Alchemist brews up an unstable concoction that he can throw at an enemy hero, to stun and deal damage in an area around the explosion. The longer the concoction brews, the more damage it deals and the longer the stun. Alchemist is faster while charging the concoction. After %brew_time% seconds, the brew reaches its maximum damage and stun time. However, after %brew_explosion% seconds, the concoction will explode on Alchemist himself if not thrown.", "notes_zh": ["摇制开始后，本技能替换为投掷不稳定化合物。炼金术士在摇制期间可以像平常一样移动和攻击。", "炼金术士的头顶会有倒计时，提示剩余的摇制时间。倒计时对敌人可见。", "可以用此技能将自己反补。", "不稳定化合物无法被躲避，并且不稳定化合物被掷出后会停止调制。", "不稳定化合物的爆炸会对英雄和非英雄单位造成伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["brew_time", "brew_explosion", "min_stun", "max_stun", "max_damage", "radius", "move_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "displace_other", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "alchemist_corrosive_weaponry", "name_zh": "炼金术士·腐蚀兵械", "name_en": "Corrosive Weaponry", "description_zh": "炼金术士使他的武器浸满强酸，对击中的敌人施加可叠加的减速和基础攻击力降低效果。\n\n每次攻击施加%stacks_per_attack%层叠加效果。不稳定化合物每调制1秒施加%one_tooltip%层叠加效果。", "description_en": "Alchemist coats his weapons and empowers his spells with an acid that applies a stacking slow and base attack damage reduction to enemies hit.\n\nAttacks apply %stacks_per_attack% stacks. Unstable Concoction applies %one_tooltip% stack per second of brew time.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["max_stacks", "debuff_duration", "slow_per_stack", "attack_dmg_per_stack", "stacks_per_attack", "one_tooltip"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "attack_damage_reduction", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "alchemist_berserk_potion", "name_zh": "炼金术士·狂暴药剂", "name_en": "Berserk Potion", "description_zh": "炼金术士向友军目标扔出一瓶药剂，施加弱驱散效果，并提供攻击速度、移动速度和生命恢复。驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Alchemist throws a potion at an ally, applying a basic dispel and giving them attack speed, movement speed and HP regen.DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "attack_speed", "hp_regen", "projectile_speed", "move_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "alchemist_goblins_greed", "name_zh": "炼金术士·贪魔的贪婪", "name_en": "Greevil's Greed", "description_zh": "炼金术士将敌人的尸体和赏金神符转化成额外的金币。炼金术士每杀死一个单位，就能获得基础额外金钱和附加额外金钱。如果炼金术士在接下来%duration%秒内又杀死了一个单位，获得了黄金，那么他所获得的附加额外金钱将有一定幅度的增加。另外，赏金神符将提供成倍金钱。", "description_en": "Alchemist synthesizes additional gold from his enemies and bounty runes. With each kill, Alchemist earns base bonus gold and extra bonus gold. If Alchemist kills another unit which yields gold within the next %duration% seconds, an additional instance of Extra Bonus Gold is added to the total. Additionally, causes bounty runes to yield more gold.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "炼金术士熔铸阿哈利姆神杖并让一位友方英雄获得所有神杖升级效果。炼金术士每送出一把神杖都将获得%scepter_bonus_damage%点攻击力加成，贪魔的贪婪的基础和最高金钱增加%bonus_gold_per_scepter%。", "en": "Alchemist melts down Aghanim's Scepter to grant an allied hero all Aghanim's Scepter upgrades. Alchemist will gain bonus %scepter_bonus_damage% damage and %bonus_gold_per_scepter% additional base and max Greevil's Greed Extra Gold for each melted Scepter."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["duration", "bonus_gold", "bonus_gold_tooltip", "bonus_bonus_gold", "bonus_gold_per_scepter", "bounty_multiplier", "damage", "bonus_gold_cap", "bonus_gold_cap_tooltip", "scepter_bonus_damage", "scepter_bonus_damage_tooltip", "scepter_spell_amp", "AbilityCastPoint"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "economy", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "alchemist_chemical_rage", "name_zh": "炼金术士·化学狂暴", "name_en": "Chemical Rage", "description_zh": "炼金术士诱发他的食人魔同伴进入化学狂暴，降低攻击间隔，提高移动速度和生命恢复。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Alchemist causes his Ogre to enter a chemically induced rage, reducing base attack cooldown and increasing movement speed and health regeneration.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["拥有%transformation_time%秒的变身时间，可以用来躲避攻击和技能弹道以及眩晕技能。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "transformation_time", "base_attack_time", "bonus_health_regen", "bonus_movespeed", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "cooldown_reduction", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "heal_reduction", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "projectile_dodge", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "invoker_quas", "name_zh": "祈求者·冰", "name_en": "Quas", "description_zh": "允许祈求者掌控冰元素。每个活跃的冰元素会让祈求者获得生命恢复加成。每级冰被动提供额外力量。", "description_en": "Allows manipulation of ice elements. Active Quas instances imbue Invoker with bonus hp regeneration. Passively grants bonus strength per level of Quas.", "notes_zh": ["祈求者最多只有3个元素。", "不会打破隐身状态，而且可以在持续施法期间施放。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提供%scepter_bonus_levels%级当前和最高等级。", "en": "Grants %scepter_bonus_levels% current and max level."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_level", "hp_regen_per_instance", "upgrade_at_level", "strength_bonus", "scepter_bonus_levels", "facet_bonus_levels"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "invoker_invoke", "name_zh": "祈求者·元素祈唤", "name_en": "Invoke", "description_zh": "将当前掌握的元素精华融合，创造出新的法术供祈求者施放。每个元素球的等级都会减少%cooldown_reduction_per_orb%秒元素祈唤的冷却时间。祈求者达到%first_ability_level%、%second_ability_level%和%third_ability_level%时会分别额外获得一点技能点。祈求者高深的魔法学识让他可以从多个阿哈利姆神杖和魔晶升级效果中进行选择。物品必须先激活才能生效，而且选择后无法更改。点击帮助按钮可查看所有可用法术。", "description_en": "Combines the properties of the elements currently being manipulated to create a new spell for Invoker to use. Invoke cooldown is reduced by %cooldown_reduction_per_orb% seconds for each orb level.  Invoker gains a bonus ability point for his orbs at levels %first_ability_level%, %second_ability_level%, and %third_ability_level%.Invoker's vast knowledge of magic allows him to choose from Multiple Aghanim's Scepter and Shard options.  The items must be activated before they can be used, and cannot be changed after they are chosen. Click the help button to see the list of possible spells.", "notes_zh": ["生成的技能与三个球的排列顺序无关。", "只是交换现有技能的位置并不会消耗魔法，也不会触发元素祈唤的冷却。", "元素祈唤不会打破隐身状态，而且可以在持续施法期间施放。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_invoked_spells", "cooldown_reduction_per_orb", "first_ability_level", "second_ability_level", "third_ability_level", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "cooldown_reduction", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "invoker_cold_snap", "name_zh": "祈求者·急速冷却", "name_en": "Cold Snap", "description_zh": "祈求者将敌人的热量抽空，将其降到绝对零度，持续时间取决于冰元素等级。敌人将受到伤害并被短暂冻结，后续攻击会使敌人再次冻结并造成额外伤害。被冻结的频率固定，但是冻结的冷却时间将会随着冰元素等级提高而缩短。", "description_en": "Invoker draws the heat from an enemy, chilling them to their very core for a duration based on the level of Quas. The enemy will take damage and be briefly frozen. Further damage taken in this state will freeze the enemy again, dealing bonus damage. The enemy can only be frozen so often, but the freeze cooldown decreases based on the level of Quas.", "notes_zh": ["只有%damage_trigger%点以上的实际伤害才能触发急速冷却。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "freeze_duration", "freeze_cooldown", "freeze_damage", "freeze_heal", "damage_trigger", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}]}
